{"publicId":"0f538dbd-5aec-447f-88bd-a681fabb3beb","title":"Würzburg大学团队首次成功分离稳定硼氧三键化合物，解决60年难题","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-10-28T14:00:06.000Z","latestAt":"2026-10-28T14:00:06.000Z","digest":"Würzburg大学博士研究生Lukas Lubczyk和Christian Markl通过二硼累积烯与酮类反应，意外获得并成功分离出稳定的硼氧三键化合物（原报道），该成果解决了困扰化学界60年的分离难题（原报道）。新报道补充指出，该反应首次合成了具有特殊结构的氧硼烷分子（ScienceDaily 2026-11-07），《Nature Chemistry》已发表详细合成方法（原报道 2026-10-28）。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-07T12:39:07.288Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Würzburg大学团队在《Nature Chemistry》发表60年挑战终获突破：成功分离含硼氧三键的罕见分子","latestReport":{"id":"zlwhck117o4no28ulfno8id12"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"f0_ktOp8jAis","title":"详细描述了合成和分离一系列意外稳定的硼氧键化合物的方法","firstReportAt":"2026-10-28T14:00:06.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"zlwhck117o4no28ulfno8id12","title":"Würzburg大学团队在《Nature Chemistry》发表60年挑战终获突破：成功分离含硼氧三键的罕见分子","summary":"Würzburg大学团队在《Nature Chemistry》发表60年挑战终获突破：成功分离含硼氧三键的罕见分子。博士研究生Lukas Lubczyk和Christian Markl通过将二硼累积烯与不同酮类反应，意外获得异常橙黄色固体。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-10-28T14:00:06.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"zlwhck117o4no28ulfno8id12","title":"Würzburg大学团队在《Nature Chemistry》发表60年挑战终获突破：成功分离含硼氧三键的罕见分子","summary":"Würzburg大学团队在《Nature Chemistry》发表60年挑战终获突破：成功分离含硼氧三键的罕见分子。博士研究生Lukas Lubczyk和Christian Markl通过将二硼累积烯与不同酮类反应，意外获得异常橙黄色固体。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-10-28T14:00:06.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-07T13:00:00.000Z","heat":6.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T14:00:00.000Z","heat":6.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T15:00:00.000Z","heat":6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T16:00:00.000Z","heat":5.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T17:00:00.000Z","heat":5.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T18:00:00.000Z","heat":5.5,"